  "id": "red-and-green-jalapen-o-jelly",
  "name": "Red and Green Jalapeño Jelly",
  "subtitle": "A bright, sweet-hot pepper spread",
  "description": "A colorful jelly made by simmering chopped peppers with sugar and cider vinegar, then setting the mixture with liquid pectin.",
